Name: Oxc (The JavaScript Oxidation Compiler)
Short Name: oxc
URL: https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Version: 0.62.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/oxc
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/tsgolint

Description:
Collection of high-performance JavaScript/TypeScript tools written in Rust: parser, linter (oxlint), formatter (oxfmt), transformer, minifier, and resolver.

Local Modifications:
- Used alongside Upstream Bun v1.4.4+ and GTS for sub-millisecond static analysis.
